 "text": "Hi, how's everything with you? Try sitting on it. If your feet touch the ground, it's too short. If you have to sit on big box, it' too long. You should rise and fall with each pedal without getting too bent forward. If you do too much forward bend, the bike is too long. Says your bike is too long if you lean too much forward. Then lift one leg on the pedals. Then the bike might be too short for you. You can increase the length with a longer crank or shorten it with a wheel spacer. Which do you rather do? Then lengthen it. A shorter stem can help too, if you already have one.",
